1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,816
A Bilibili player asked:

2
00:00:01,816 --> 00:00:04,468
"Can you make an 'I am the bugs' mode?"

3
00:00:04,468 --> 00:00:06,742
So I built it the same day.

4
00:00:06,742 --> 00:00:09,963
No more defending — you ARE the swarm.

5
00:00:11,506 --> 00:00:14,281
Simple rule: inside 360 seconds,

6
00:00:14,281 --> 00:00:16,461
tear down the human base core.

7
00:00:16,461 --> 00:00:19,633
Against you: 6 defenders, 9 turrets and buildings,

8
00:00:19,633 --> 00:00:21,417
a 2500-HP gate,

9
00:00:21,417 --> 00:00:23,993
and a 2000-HP core behind it.

10
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:27,452
The controls are flipped.

11
00:00:27,452 --> 00:00:30,887
WASD drives the Mother, J bites, K spits acid,

12
00:00:30,887 --> 00:00:34,752
U summons warriors, I flyers, O molts, L dashes.

13
00:00:34,752 --> 00:00:36,898
The only resource is Biomass:

14
00:00:36,898 --> 00:00:40,333
every point of damage you deal comes back,

15
00:00:40,333 --> 00:00:42,695
summoning and healing both cost it.

16
00:00:44,214 --> 00:00:46,335
Human turrets show no mercy.

17
00:00:46,335 --> 00:00:48,070
Stand at the gate and chew it,

18
00:00:48,070 --> 00:00:50,576
and the sniper takes 160 HP a shot.

19
00:00:50,576 --> 00:00:54,432
Low? Molt: 40 Biomass heals 35%;

20
00:00:54,432 --> 00:00:56,938
send small bugs to soak the fire —

21
00:00:56,938 --> 00:00:59,252
turrets always hit the nearest unit.

22
00:01:00,796 --> 00:01:03,361
The Mother can die, but only 5 times.

23
00:01:03,361 --> 00:01:07,637
Each death respawns her at full HP; on the fifth,

24
00:01:07,637 --> 00:01:09,134
the swarm collapses.

25
00:01:10,658 --> 00:01:12,002
The gate — is down!

26
00:01:12,002 --> 00:01:15,363
Bugs pour in, the Mother charges after them.

27
00:01:15,363 --> 00:01:19,396
If this looks fun, hit like.

28
00:01:20,928 --> 00:01:21,939
After the breach,

29
00:01:21,939 --> 00:01:25,780
I drove the Mother through the hole — bunker,

30
00:01:25,780 --> 00:01:28,004
cannon and sniper on both flanks,

31
00:01:28,004 --> 00:01:30,228
one life gone in twenty seconds.

32
00:01:34,928 --> 00:01:38,808
Result: gate destroyed, five Mother deaths,

33
00:01:38,808 --> 00:01:42,076
110s left, core untouched at full HP.

34
00:01:42,076 --> 00:01:45,547
Honestly this mode is much harder than I thought —

35
00:01:45,547 --> 00:01:47,794
it's a real challenge mode now.

36
00:01:47,794 --> 00:01:51,266
Think you can crack the core? Prove me wrong.

37
00:01:52,782 --> 00:01:56,373
Playable now — link in the description.

38
00:01:56,373 --> 00:01:59,207
Next: more bug unit types

39
00:01:59,207 --> 00:02:00,908
and another balance pass.

40
00:02:00,908 --> 00:02:03,932
What should you get to play as next? Tell me below.
